  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow></msub></math> is a molecule that consists of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>60</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> atoms, arranged as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn></math> pentagons and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn></math> hexagons.<br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/7b593135-273a-461a-a69c-bb3d8894f67f-image.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 211px;\" /><br />It has&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math> trigons.",
